# exp3-analysis docs are CONFIDENTIAL (data-leakage findings, papers not yet corrected):
# not tracked, kept local only.
# EXCEPTION — the recorded-value analysis summary is PUBLIC (no confidential findings).
# Re-include the dir (so git can descend) then only the specific public file + figures;
# the confidential *.md and figures/c1_stat/ have no negation, so they stay ignored.
!docs/experiments/results/exp3-analysis/
!docs/experiments/results/exp3-analysis/c1_recorded_value_analysis.md
# Migration plan for retiring the Within modes: cites only values already public in the
# recorded-value summary above, plus script paths. No confidential findings.
!docs/experiments/results/exp3-analysis/within_retirement_plan.md
!docs/experiments/results/exp3-analysis/figures/
!docs/experiments/results/exp3-analysis/figures/c1_recorded/
